## Historical imports

Files under `experiments/historical/` may include code developed while working inside a local Brain2Qwerty checkout. Where a file is substantially derived from upstream source code, the applicable upstream copyright and license terms remain in effect.

The repository intentionally avoids importing unrelated Brain2Qwerty v2 code, website assets, or other upstream material that is not necessary to document the EEG2Qwerty work.
